          "text": "Ciyoobeda Jehova wamakamu citondezyo abukamboni mucisi ca-Egepita, nkaambo bayookwiilila Jehova nkaambo kabasikupenzya, elyo uyoobatumina mufutuli, muvuni, uyoobafutula. ",
