          "text": "Jehova uyoozibwa kuba-Egepita, abalo baEgepita bayooziba Jehova mubuzuba obo. Bayookomba akuleta cipaizyo acituuzyo, Bayoolumbila Jehova cilumbizyo, alimwi balacicita mbubonya. ",
